msgid "To exercise it on a host without btrfs tooling, install `baudolo-snapshot` into a throwaway privileged container and run it there. Note that a container's `/dev` carries no `/dev/loopN` nodes, so `losetup --find` finds nothing and the matrix reports `SKIP` unless they are created first (`mknod /dev/loop0 b 7 0`, …) or the host's `/dev` is bind-mounted in."
